---
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<section id="about" class="reveal">
    <div class="wrap about-grid">
        <div>
            <p class="eyebrow-num">02 / about</p>
            <h2>About</h2>
            <p>
                I'm <strong>{site.name}</strong>, a driven Full-Stack Systems Developer based in Durban, South Africa. I hold a Diploma (HDIPSD2) from Boston City Campus with a 76% Pass with Distinction average, alongside CompTIA A+ and Security+ credentials.
            </p>
            <p>
                I build across the full development stack — <strong>Java, PHP, JavaScript / TypeScript, React, Astro, Node.js, Docker, and MySQL</strong> — and am actively gaining hands-on cloud experience through real work involving <strong>AWS (VPC, EC2, CI/CD Pipelines)</strong>. I approach cloud infrastructure as an area of active growth and welcome mentorship as I deepen my expertise.
            </p>
            <p>
                Beyond technical execution, I bring strong practice in business analysis, requirements gathering, and full-lifecycle client project delivery. Whether engineering bespoke web applications, supporting cloud deployments, or taking on contract roles, I focus on security, clean code, and dependable delivery.
            </p>
        </div>
        <ul class="facts">
            <li><span class="k">based</span><span class="v">{site.city}</span></li>
            <li><span class="k">status</span><span class="v" style="color: #34d399;">{site.availability}</span></li>
            <li><span class="k">focus</span><span class="v">{site.focusLabel}</span></li>
            <li><span class="k">currently</span><span class="v">{site.currently}</span></li>
            <li><span class="k">cloud</span><span class="v">AWS (VPC, EC2, CI/CD — learning stage)</span></li>
            <li><span class="k">education</span><span class="v">Diploma HDIPSD2 (76% Distinction)</span></li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</section>
